- [ ] Confirm the detection method reports "installed" only after a real install, and "absent"
      on a clean machine.
- [ ] Confirm the selected context (System/User) matches how this application must run.
- [ ] Review every finding below, especially anything marked `Blocking` or `Warning`.
- [ ] Review the per-field provenance table for any Low or Medium confidence value.
- [ ] If this is a wrapper MSI, confirm the uninstall command is NOT `msiexec /x`.
- [ ] Test the generated package end to end before assigning it to a production collection
